#: includes/class-retreat.php:405
msgid "Your letter for [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames]"
msgstr "La vostra carta per a [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames]"

#: includes/class-retreat.php:415
msgid ""
"Hello, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the letter you wrote to [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] for the retreat \"[retreat_name]\".\n"
"\n"
"In the end, [attendant_name] did not attend the retreat. For confidentiality and data protection reasons, we are going to destroy the digital record of your letter and the printed copy that had been prepared to be delivered.\n"
"\n"
"Your letter is attached to this email, so that you can keep it and use it again if [attendant_name] takes part in a retreat in the coming months.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards."
msgstr ""
"Hola, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Us agraïm la carta que vau escriure a [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] per al recés «[retreat_name]».\n"
"\n"
"Finalment, [attendant_name] no ha participat en el recés. Per motius de confidencialitat i de protecció de dades, destruirem el registre digital de la vostra carta i la còpia impresa que s'havia preparat per a lliurar-la.\n"
"\n"
"Us adjuntem la vostra carta en aquest correu electrònic, perquè la pugueu conservar i tornar a utilitzar si [attendant_name] participa en un recés en els propers mesos.\n"
"\n"
"Salutacions cordials."

#: includes/class-security.php:93
msgid "DFX Parish Retreat Letters: OpenSSL extension is required for the confidential message system."
msgstr "DFX Cartes de recessos parroquials: cal l'extensió OpenSSL per al sistema de missatges confidencials."

#: includes/class-security.php:157
msgid "DFX Parish Retreat Letters: The encryption key is stored in the database. For better security, please define DFXPRL_ENCRYPTION_KEY in wp-config.php."
msgstr "DFX Cartes de recessos parroquials: la clau de xifratge està desada a la base de dades. Per a més seguretat, definiu DFXPRL_ENCRYPTION_KEY al wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-security.php:159
msgid "You can generate a secure key using the following code:"
msgstr "Podeu generar una clau segura amb el codi següent:"

#: includes/class-security.php:161
msgid "Place this line in your wp-config.php file to secure the key."
msgstr "Afegiu aquesta línia al fitxer wp-config.php per a protegir la clau."

#: includes/class-security.php:183
msgid "DFX Parish Retreat Letters: Encryption Key Mismatch"
msgstr "DFX Cartes de recessos parroquials: la clau de xifratge no coincideix"

#: includes/class-security.php:186
msgid "The encryption key defined in wp-config.php does not match the one stored in the database."
msgstr "La clau de xifratge definida al wp-config.php no coincideix amb la desada a la base de dades."

#: includes/class-security.php:189
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Avís:"

#: includes/class-security.php:190
msgid "Only the key defined in wp-config.php will be used. If any messages were already encrypted using the database key, they will become unreadable."
msgstr "Només s'utilitzarà la clau definida al wp-config.php. Si ja s'havien xifrat missatges amb la clau de la base de dades, no es podran llegir."

#: includes/class-security.php:193
msgid "You can either:"
msgstr "Podeu fer una de les accions següents:"

#: includes/class-security.php:196
msgid "Update the key in wp-config.php to match the database key, or"
msgstr "Actualitzar la clau del wp-config.php perquè coincideixi amb la de la base de dades, o bé"

#: includes/class-security.php:197
msgid "Remove the key from the database to use the wp-config.php key (click the button below)"
msgstr "Eliminar la clau de la base de dades per a utilitzar la del wp-config.php (feu clic al botó de sota)"

#: includes/class-security.php:201
msgid "Remove Database Key and Use wp-config.php Key"
msgstr "Elimina la clau de la base de dades i utilitza la del wp-config.php"

#: includes/class-security.php:224
msgid "Are you sure you want to remove the encryption key from the database? Any messages encrypted with the old key will become unreadable. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Segur que voleu eliminar la clau de xifratge de la base de dades? Els missatges xifrats amb la clau antiga no es podran llegir. Aquesta acció no es pot desfer."

